u're like oh okay he's gonna just  exit the scene but then he stands up on  the motorcycle and he's balancing and  that smile that he gives to the camera  that moment is probably the most  entertaining part of that  friendship moves and then he just begins  a process of back and forth  riding with handstand and then you see  him popping a wheelie there's a charm to  it  the fact that everybody knows that face  and everybody knows how serious  terminator traditionally is seeing  terminator with a smile goofing around  in a friendship again we're so grateful  we're allowed to do that  just sells that friendship move  perfectly  so that is every friendship move in  mortal kombat 11. there was a lot to  cover  i hope you learned a little bit about  how we designed these moves and maybe  thought of a different way to finish him
 

